---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About Civilized Rides</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-stone">
      <p class="mb-6">
        Civilized Rides is a curated collection of bike routes around the Boston area. Roots generally start from either Porter Square or Harvard Square, And they end at either a coffee shop or a place to get beers.
        Civilized Rides meet three key criteria:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc list-inside my-6">
        <li>They provide a challenging workout - some nice climbs and roads where you can drop the hammer</li>
        <li>Most of the route is pleasant to ride on, doesn't have a lot of roads where drivers want to kill you, and is attractive to look at</li>
        <li>They include stops for sightseeing, snacks, premium coffee, and/or light beers</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-6">
        Each route has been personally ridden and documented, with suggestions for
        the best places to stop along the way.
      </p>

      <!-- Add more content here as needed -->
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
